# Editing JES entities
@scenario tutorial_lesson_25
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg room]
[char ginger global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show ginger guide shy]
ginger: The little light on this panel is an entity of its own. Shall we change its color without repainting the panel?
ginger: Open scripts/scenes/panel.jes in the JES editor. Select the indicator and change its fill color.
> Review question -> check
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label check
ginger: Which change should affect only the indicator?
> Edit the named indicator entity. -> correct
> Tint the entire stage. -> retry
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label retry
[show ginger guide confused]
ginger: Separate entities give the editor independent targets. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show ginger guide normal]
ginger: Separate entities give the editor independent targets.
> Back to topics -> return_hub
> Replay example -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_25]
[flag tutorial_done_25]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_5]
